### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/health

### Register Client
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "1234567890",
  "role": "CLIENT"
}

### Register Professional
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jane Smith",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "role": "PROFESSIONAL",
  "professionalType": "PLANNER",
  "yearsExperience": 5,
  "bio": "Experienced house planner with 5 years of experience",
  "location": "New York"
}

### Login (Client)
